{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Registration received{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
  <div class="panel panel--success">
    <h1>Registration received</h1>
    <p>Your reference number is</p>
    <p class="reference">{{ reference }}</p>
  </div>
  <p>Write down this reference number now. It will not be shown again, and it is not sent anywhere else in this prototype.</p>
  <p>The reference number alone does not give access to the record. In the proposed service, a confirmation email would contain only this number and no personal details.</p>
  <p>In this prototype, records are routed to a synthetic demonstration mission or to the headquarters queue. No real mission jurisdictions have been approved.</p>
  <p><a href="{{ path('register') }}">Submit another synthetic registration</a></p>
{% endblock %}
